{"parentUuid":null,"isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"ac9e83ba97f6f4f5e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":"Audit R13 调研 agent `adee29cf670b5c3dc` 关于 Pumpkin / Glasgow / Huub 三个 LCG 求解器的 claim。这是 follow-up source-verify audit。\n\n## 项目背景\n\n终末地路线图 R13 升级 Pumpkin (P3→P2 #31 binding D''' audit) + Glasgow (P3→P2 #32 sidecar audit)，工时估 3-5 day / 5-7 day。如果这些 claim 错了，PoC 路径不存在。\n\n## R13 agent 的关键 claim（需要 audit）\n\n读 transcript 文件：`/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd/docs/research/agent_transcripts/adee29cf670b5c3dc.output`\n\n### Pumpkin\n\n(1) **Pumpkin v0.3.0 PyPI release 2026-02-11**\n(2) **wheels 覆盖 CPython 3.8-3.14 全平台**\n(3) **`pumpkin-solver-py/` 完整 Python binding（model/variables/constraints/optimisation/brancher）**\n(4) **5 个 pytest 测试文件 + nqueens/optimisation 示例**\n(5) **Propagator 已实现：cumulative / disjunctive / element / 算术（lin、div、mul、max、abs）/ 子句**\n(6) **Propagator 暂缺：circuit / no_overlap_2d / table / all_different**\n(7) **2025 MiniZinc Challenge fixed-search 铜牌**\n(8) **repo 主体: github.com/ConSol-Lab/Pumpkin (TU Delft, NOT Imperial)**\n\n### Glasgow Constraint Solver\n\n(9) **github.com/ciaranm/glasgow-constraint-solver 1263 commits, 2026-05-09 仍每日 commit**\n(10) **gcspy Python binding 已上线（`python/gcspy.cc/.hh` pybind11）**\n(11) **VeriPB 3.0 proof logging 是招牌特性**\n(12) **作者自称 \"no stable API\"**\n(13) **C++23 编译门槛（GCC 13+/Clang 21+）**\n\n### Huub\n\n(14) **github.com/huub-solver/huub 2026-05-08 commit, 极活跃**\n(15) **CP 2025 paper 《Towards Modern and Modular SAT for LCG》(Dekker)**\n(16) **没有 Python binding**\n(17) **constraint 列表：bool_array_element, cumulative, disjunctive, int_abs, int_array_element, int_array_minimum, int_div, int_linear, int_mul, int_no_overlap (1D), int_pow, int_set_contains, int_table, int_unique (=all_different 单值), int_value_precede**\n(18) **circuit / no_overlap_2d / flow 仍然没有**\n\n## Audit 任务\n\n1. **Pumpkin PyPI**: WebFetch `https://pypi.org/project/pumpkin-solver/`\n   - v0.3.0 真存在？日期？\n\n2. **Pumpkin GitHub**: WebFetch `https://github.com/ConSol-Lab/Pumpkin`\n   - 仓库存在 + 是 TU Delft 不是 Imperial？\n   - `pumpkin-solver-py/` 目录真存在？\n   - 最近 release / commit\n\n3. **Pumpkin Python API**: 看 `pumpkin-solver-py/` 下文件结构\n   - `tests/` 文件夹和 nqueens/optimisation example 真存在？\n\n4. **Glasgow GitHub**: WebFetch `https://github.com/ciaranm/glasgow-constraint-solver`\n   - commit 数 / 最近 commit 日期\n   - `python/gcspy.cc` 真存在？\n   - VeriPB 3.0 proof logging 是 README/feature list 还是 agent 推断\n\n5. **Huub GitHub**: WebFetch `https://github.com/huub-solver/huub`\n   - 仓库存在？\n   - `crates/huub/src/constraints/` 列出的 propagator 是否真覆盖 transcript 列表\n\n6. **CP 2025 paper Dekker**: WebSearch \"Towards Modern and Modular SAT for LCG Dekker CP 2025\"\n   - paper 真存在？\n\n每条 claim 标 CONFIRMED / PARTIALLY / REFUTED。\n\n## 输出格式（不超过 600 字，中文）\n\n```\n## Pumpkin (8 条)\n| # | claim | verdict | 备注 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n...\n\n## Glasgow (5 条)\n...\n\n## Huub (5 条)\n...\n\n## 关键修正\n[列错的]\n\n## 路线图修订建议\n- P2 #31 Pumpkin PoC 工时 3-5d: 仍有效 / 修订到 X / Pumpkin 实际不可用 → 移回 P3\n- P2 #32 Glasgow PoC 工时 5-7d: ...\n\n## verdict\nCONFIRMED / PARTIALLY / REFUTED\n```\n\n## 操作准则\n\n- 必须 WebFetch 实际 PyPI / GitHub\n- 不要 trust transcript URL 没 actual fetch\n- 简洁\n\n开始。"},"uuid":"43b1a4fb-a093-4622-bfd8-627ed212eb2d","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:50:43.737Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
