{"parentUuid":"6533a94d-7f13-4cb3-a0ec-8846fa8202b0","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"ac9e83ba97f6f4f5e","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-7","id":"msg_01Jik92SX3xkBmJAxAJgbtct","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JgbVVBHmCByA9b7YJzYfUJ","name":"WebFetch","input":{"url":"https://github.com/ConSol-Lab/Pumpkin","prompt":"Find: (1) repository owner organization (TU Delft? Imperial College?); (2) is there a `pumpkin-solver-py/` directory? (3) most recent commit date; (4) most recent release tag/version; (5) any mention of MiniZinc Challenge 2025 results."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":6,"cache_creation_input_tokens":16611,"cache_read_input_tokens":11009,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":16611,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}},"requestId":"req_011CasthXRrXBBbT8EDW5GSv","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"54a09417-2e77-4fcd-b767-7ddd8bdb0093","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:50:56.123Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"6533a94d-7f13-4cb3-a0ec-8846fa8202b0","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6fa20b73-a995-4ae4-b928-344e193a8ce4","agentId":"ac9e83ba97f6f4f5e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01X6E3dB2iyyKqP8REqi9e5Z","type":"tool_result","content":"# pumpkin-solver Package Analysis\n\n## (1) Latest Version Number\nThe latest version is **0.3.0**, released on February 11, 2026.\n\n## (2) Release Dates\n- **0.3.0**: February 11, 2026\n- **0.2.2**: November 10, 2025\n- **0.2.1.post1**: October 2, 2025\n- **0.2.1**: September 18, 2025\n\n## (3) Supported Python Versions in Wheels\nThe package supports multiple Python implementations:\n\n- **CPython**: 3.8, 3.9, 3.10, 3.11, 3.12, 3.13, 3.14\n- **CPython threaded variants**: 3.13t, 3.14t\n- **PyPy**: 3.9, 3.10, 3.11\n\nThe metadata indicates \"Requires: Python >=3.8\"\n\n## (4) Platforms Covered\nThe wheel distributions span these platforms:\n\n- **Linux**: manylinux (glibc 2.5+, 2.17+), musllinux (musl 1.2+)\n- **Architectures**: x86-64, i686, ARMv7l, ARM64 (aarch64)\n- **macOS**: 10.12+ x86-64, 11.0+ ARM64\n- **Windows**: x86-64 (win_amd64), x86 (win32)"}]},"uuid":"6098f4d4-c72f-4c24-84e7-b932304938c0","timestamp":"2026-05-09T23:50:58.032Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"6533a94d-7f13-4cb3-a0ec-8846fa8202b0","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/zhuran24/claude-pj/zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.138","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
