thmetic(absolute_value, integer_division/multiplication, linear_less_or_equal, linear_not_equal, maximum)/nogoods |\n| 6 | 暂缺 circuit / no_overlap_2d / table / all_different | **REFUTED** | `all_different.rs` 和 `table.rs` 都存在于 `pumpkin-crates/constraints/src/constraints/`，**仅** circuit / no_overlap_2d 真的缺 |\n| 7 | 2025 MiniZinc fixed-search 铜牌 | CONFIRMED | README 有铜牌段 |\n| 8 | repo: ConSol-Lab/Pumpkin (TU Delft) | CONFIRMED | \"developed by the ConSol Lab at TU Delft\" |\n\n## Glasgow (5 条)\n\n| # | claim | verdict | 备注 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 9 | 1263 commits, 仍每日 commit | CONFIRMED | 1263 commits；最新 commit 2026-05-09 21:58 UTC |\n| 10 | gcspy Python binding (gcspy.cc/.hh pybind11) | CONFIRMED | `python/`: CMakeLists.txt, gcspy.cc, gcspy.hh, pyproject.toml, python_test.py |\n| 11 | VeriPB 3.0 proof logging | CONFIRMED | 文档原文 \"Currently we are using the VeriPB 3.0 format\" |\n| 12 | \"no stable API\" | CONFIRMED | README 原话 \"no stable API or design\" |\n| 13 | C++23 (GCC 13+/Clang 21+) | CONFIRMED | \"A C++23 compiler\"; GCC 13 oldest tested, Clang 21 primary dev |\n\n## Huub (5 条)\n\n| # | claim | verdict | 备注 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 14 | 仓库 2026-05-08 commit, 极活跃 | CONFIRMED | 最新 commit 2026-05-08（develop 分支 384 commits）|\n| 15 | CP 2025 paper Dekker | CONFIRMED | LIPIcs.CP.2025.42; 作者 Dekker/Ignatiev/Stuckey/Zhong |\n| 16 | 没有 Python binding | CONFIRMED | Rust 98.1%，crates 树无 python 目录 |\n| 17 | constraint 列表 | CONFIRMED | `crates/huub/src/constraints/` 15 项全部存在 |\n| 18 | circuit / no_overlap_2d / flow 仍然没有 | CONFIRMED | tree 中无 circuit.rs / no_overlap_2d.rs / flow.rs |\n\n## 关键修正\n\n- **claim 6 错（Pumpkin all_different + table）**: 这俩 propagator **已实现** (`pumpkin-crates/constraints/src/constraints/all_different.rs` + `table.rs`)。真正缺的只有 circuit + no_overlap_2d。这是本次 audit 唯一硬错。\n- **claim 3（Pumpkin Python binding）**含糊**：API 表面是 Python（pip 装、pytest 测）但实现是 PyO3 Rust 不是纯 Python。对 PoC 不影响（用法等价）。\n\n## 路线图修订建议\n\n- **P2 #31 Pumpkin PoC 工时 3-5d**: **维持 + 加分**。原 claim 6